# Applies to docker/Dockerfile.dev only.
#
# The dev image bakes in a binary you already built (`make build`), so this one
# file is the only thing it needs from the build context. The top-level
# .dockerignore excludes bin/ on purpose, because the main Dockerfile compiles
# from source inside the container.
*

!bin/clacks
!docker/entrypoint.sh
